      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70607d2f10a81c5aaf0b0c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服无论何时，都要保持整洁利落！",
      "source_fingerprint": "786965f59ff3638d09d5356982d5cd6ae728a0f11ab210bb52b7e7ae402c884f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee45a84fd43c284823b7090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台中心唱歌的模样，请看着哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e7fa8c3fd12df806c50f3b2b0cd4ef1974b3e6eaed51254a870b042bbafedca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e46365a9de734d0109388f32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？请尽情为我欢呼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f99ce408141d2d3a32a0b6685e7dcc660e71047780a72982532c5f9216dcfe60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3227cfaadebe32366da2e0a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在学校，真开心！大家也都是好孩子♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "38d71ac6be1b6353f019c84bd8b977f954100d9d7b75b4972a701a593b7018b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08cfc1c71880aae21e0244d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要表演什么舞步，给大家看呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e178c8c1b00048710160615053eb4692c7eeaa56ad5f05a6f04bd147204912f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6c7447bb1890bfce174bc0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实是亲手做的！早安英里布贴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d67af892e436659ce34e4644512d503d36a8be802298eb191d80045e0de0c581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:570e970aa200bb56ffb76934",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真棒！兴奋120英里☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc8df1bf18fcf3336f1df9aea86ae3e1ba95f3294d7759e2e829f7bc4fa0aec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc02acba88f013bae54ca574",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很适合我吧，这种风格也一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0c3b8911767a15ab752821295f001ee2a6a9c3b7017cf135300e2556d6b6b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28bd7dc755b3f9a6d44e82c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df094ff1112517c623c111a7239f2b6398134743fb570a85aa6a2f9f1f8889",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c12520bac62567fbd2749f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安英里！嘿嘿……这是我的宣言\r\n哦。我会成为配得上这声问候的，真正的\r\n英里女王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aa321201c253e6587787b531b0649a6835b09e2b1d6ff661cff618688757f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22064d948c01cd3fa1823a20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "计步器，我随身带着！\r\n想知道今天移动了多少英里！\r\n最少也想达到20英里～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8320417d4c75a1caa2933a6eeac5d50a5830a50db2609383c501e48bc411c3a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62460f6472822c4b4f766509",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没胃口时，就看卡丁车的\r\n视频！这是英里规则☆这么做之后\r\n不可思议地，就有食欲了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61f1ce554228ade9723817a87e67d48aad45886f8bf5f24151eb36bb21c48655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34d153f92d7b12743e3ca617",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员♪差不多该休息\r\n了！饭，你还没吃吧？\r\n我很担心你哦，大概10英里",
      "source_fingerprint": "480d0c185540c51ae3b70128b83ec6bf9fab8ff5945e0993936b6ff8c81e29cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c044a0505efc0d9f28875c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这个人，入睡可是很快的！\r\n所以躺上床后，数鳗鱼\r\n从来没数到过10条！",
      "source_fingerprint": "501dc822e52c687281c2003f611846b0b912b28d00d160e81b626848daf0645e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065d7e17b94b20e6139c7b69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最后一道沙拉，选什么好呢……一天\r\n始于沙拉终于沙拉！\r\n所以，这里绝对不能妥协！",
      "source_fingerprint": "444d2dac5d80a362587c60694a063d361bbaf1159be058fd08d732dfd0de050a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37bf83bcb77f1b0e073f6dd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花赏和NHK英里杯、安田纪念和\r\n维多利亚英里赛！春天是英里的\r\n季节呢。真让人期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f37feae6f9286584e1a9885ac0129221823de94b28bb7c03be186558e8b95a88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126defffaf1ba46637dd4644",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越是太阳耀眼的时候，越要尽量\r\n出去玩……这也是英里规则！\r\n……因为，总觉得逃了就输了",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68a61a4fb130251bca647cb52659fbdec6fdb8446213d299f83d3856a173f00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7bf12f360838db2e6fe1924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到红叶，就要添3次饭\r\n！为了获胜，\r\n必须吃得饱饱的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04559aac45b99776e90ca9ccad9253b26460976f6b5a9a24e5189cd4f26a4e80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6902decb1ec5de900b7b6b0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和强击同学做了可爱的雪人\r\n☆待会儿还要比滑雪橇\r\n和打雪仗！干劲满满！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1682fbe0d9e7240406e23b0aec3a61cdfb8bd59ee0757a349ddfacbbcd8cd3ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94a2b2236e177a3179290546",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab60eac1e79b2c251e6f35b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞机，我最喜欢了！因为\r\n可以积攒。――英里积分！\r\n呵呵，下次什么时候能再坐呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "972122f5d51b653d2872a4e11ad5b2cca139c40e7388ebe58467d2247e52b557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f87eb0ff2de0e6f0e187587",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "杏目前辈的奔跑，总觉得完全就是\r\n震撼！那种感觉！……不过，在英里赛\r\n中我一定会赢。绝对☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4c30de73a7a554eb7cb91880657eb31487dfe58729cf1d431bf92f2325da133",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdcab710c3b6bddfc97cf20d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！小创夸奖我的体格\r\n了！说很适合英里赛！\r\n嘿嘿，我也这么想☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "01063ec910ecab91f30a8f5c81f08e60592d6533233c6d678ccdb3dadfae3fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac35c99cc9b7e8d9dd01ef24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看小爱的直播，必须先做完\r\n作业！多亏这条英里规则，\r\n作业一转眼就完成了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "092d844f9e688533bfe58c093ebf75d2b65c0fb6143a6df2274456c48e06b718",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6577efda5888378927deda92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我去照料花坛了！\r\n和金花同学一起！两个人一起做，\r\n真的非常治愈呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a41ee58a202f3bbec0f303b108675e4bc42a3ef04e4400495c38ebc4bba1609",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7507c19008d2f068a6c8569d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演唱会的舞步，只要看1遍\r\n大致就能记住☆所以，\r\n舞蹈课很闲……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6909e1c3ac05a47356c873bf839a8b69f9771cc68835672d245d52d5aa64d6a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:683aa91b8cb303a463f996a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想回应粉丝的支持！因为\r\n大家都喜欢我……喜欢英里\r\n对吧？啊哈，都是英里伙伴☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "78901de6e32d914ef0ff4c2aa4b462264f1b4ef889a20a6e68cab6f2c27734a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b8ca4763f8cd724784f4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上决胜服，不知为什么……\r\n就会热得冒汗。\r\n呵呵……或许是进入状态了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c282a3ff2af03c2286fbb9fc510153a20f01418bfdaeb9cb20a94e085a6e507",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6856fedec18a3432088b908",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最推荐的，是早安英里布贴！\r\n每当快松懈下来时，我都会看看它\r\n……提醒自己不忘初心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b58641895633de695fa53abd0477760e716cd3f289fefc6a057715dc241fad10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e93c3d403b1b9237541e98d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，早安英里！\r\n……不，不是早安英里！\r\n是早安英里！哦♪来，一起喊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b802a635dd4608b36bcb0a156a59ffe4169a4b91a78b4b5afbdee99ba969968",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02a2eb66c85a9c8774eac316",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一次性筷子掰得漂亮，就允许自己\r\n再添一碗荞麦面！这也是英里规则\r\n……呵呵♪今天吃得饱饱的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a11b5fd5e4ac8094dfb11c9bbef789ade914a974fb316354da88f2880d9b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:267bd4ecb8a4fda0b981aea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃了章鱼烧的那天晚上，要躺在床上\r\n好好睡！为了遵守这条规则\r\n我还曾在大阪住过一晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d2f3b1da65c44ffa5e1a7f16bde3ca8e0da5805209d21bb67136a15287af9b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67664069f911fd4827e16e99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！这次的赏花，\r\n你有多少英里期待呢？\r\n呵呵……我的期待是你的10倍英里哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85083415e64b52ff5d881127e96115502641f3b5110e74ee61cc1c2cc4d114cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91012"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
